WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.591
Unit ten. Healthy Teeth and Gums!

2
00:00:04.562 --> 00:00:08.065
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:11.201
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:15.446
Today we learn about Healthy Teeth and Gums. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:20.436
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

6
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.537
Gums. Say it with me. Gums!

7
00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:34.359
Floss. Say it with me. Floss!

8
00:00:37.861 --> 00:00:41.811
Toothbrush. Say it with me. Toothbrush!

9
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:49.154
Fluoride. Say it with me. Fluoride!

10
00:00:52.639 --> 00:00:56.172
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

11
00:00:59.668 --> 00:01:03.151
Dentist. Say it with me. Dentist!

12
00:01:06.706 --> 00:01:10.439
Cavity. Say it with me. Cavity!

13
00:01:13.896 --> 00:01:22.455
I brush my teeth and gums twice a day with fluoride toothpaste. Too much sugar can cause a cavity. The dentist checks my teeth and shows me how to floss.

14
00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:23.655
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.995 --> 00:01:30.412
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.462 --> 00:01:31.612
Floss!

17
00:01:32.496 --> 00:01:37.751
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:38.951
Dentist!

19
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.095
Did you know? Fluoride in toothpaste helps make tooth enamel stronger!

20
00:01:45.145 --> 00:01:47.133
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.817 --> 00:01:55.428
Think and answer. Why should you brush your gums as well as your teeth?

22
00:01:55.478 --> 00:01:56.628
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.692 --> 00:02:02.509
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.559 --> 00:02:05.272
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

